                     <title>Sacramentarium (frgm.)</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">The dating of the manuscript revised from that
                        in MLGB2 fits the fact that the main body of the sacramentary includes
                        borrowings from the Romano-Germanic Pontifical. </note>
                  </msItem>
